OL,3,GNEWSACouncil bids for #40m to bypass
OL,4,Ahistoric bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #40m bid for government money to
OL,7,Fbuild a new route bypassing a Grade II*
OL,8,Flisted bridge has been submitted by a
OL,9,Fcouncil.
OL,11,FBuilt in 1824, Chetwynd Bridge near
OL,12,FAlrewas, Staffordshire, has operated
OL,13,Fwith weight and size limits on traffic
OL,14,Fsince 2020 after significant structural
OL,15,Fdefects were found.
OL,17,FStaffordshire County Council wants to
OL,18,Fbuild a new bridge as part of a #46.4m
OL,19,Fscheme in order to protect the historic
OL,20,Fstructure for use by pedestrians while
OL,21,Fkeeping the road network moving.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
