OL,4,Ahistoric bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council will hold a cabinet meeting
OL,7,Fon Wednesday to discuss the submission
OL,8,Fto the government's Structures Fund,
OL,9,Fwhich was sent in early August.
